question/math-academy-id "q-140044" :question/problem "Find $det(A)-3det(B)$, where \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & -3 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each matrix in turn.\n\n- Since $A$ has two identical columns, we obtain\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & -3 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,det(A)=0.\n$$\n\n- Since $B$ has a zero row, we obtain:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,det(B)=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $det(A)-3det(B)=0-3\\cdot 0=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-140044/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "28142e26-f6c7-54c9-9c16-035c75f7659f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140044"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "9c6555fd-6664-5a25-acfe-3c6fd3e45698" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "9ef4404c-73fd-59d2-807e-4008c6af4d98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection/aacc796a129ca965c1d1fb05f5ceff5515ad33aca5905a63b224f0c315fe8503" :answer/id #uuid "05e60e50-44bb-5505-a94d-a1f3e6d1898f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" :answer/id #uuid "623c8d25-6805-541e-a0cd-69a93b98480c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "dacb2643-442c-5010-8b85-222085b010ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e00bf8d5-3fb0-58d5-ae66-63e33278e46b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-42958/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer-field/choices ["q-42958/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-42958/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-42958/selection/aacc796a129ca965c1d1fb05f5ceff5515ad33aca5905a63b224f0c315fe8503" "q-42958/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" "q-42958/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-42958" :question/id #uuid "a6007578-80c3-5264-817e-c4f8106344f2" :question/math-academy-id "q-42958" :question/problem "Find $2det(A)+3det(B)$, where \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}0.17 & \\sqrt{5} & 4 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine each matrix in turn.\n\n- Since $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, its determinant is:\n\n$$\ndet(A)=3\\cdot 1-2\\cdot (-1)=5\n$$\n\n- Since $B$ has two identical rows, we obtain\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}0.17 & \\sqrt{5} & 4 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 6\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,det(B)=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $2det(A)+3det(B)=2\\cdot 5+3\\cdot 0=10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42958/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "28142e26-f6c7-54c9-9c16-035c75f7659f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42958"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-82286/selec